[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3120704418","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108837#issuecomment-3120704418","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108837","id":3120704418,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66Aiui","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T23:49:40Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T23:49:40Z","body":"Why not serialize `NaN` and `Infinity` as `\"NaN\"` and `\"Infinity\"` (or `\"-Infinity\"`)? This is what C# does on an opt-in basis ([link](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.text.json.serialization.jsonnumberhandling)).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3120704418/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124795644","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108837#issuecomment-3124795644","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108837","id":3124795644,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66QJj8","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-27T23:36:33Z","updated_at":"2025-08-24T17:02:01Z","body":"Two problems with the string representation:\r\n\r\n* If a field is specified as a number in a JSON schema, `\"Infinity\"` is not of that type, so such output would not be valid for that schema, while `1e99999` is still compliant.\r\n* If reading in data without any schema or other type known in advance, it will be interpreted as a string instead of a number, which means that the exporter would change the data type, while `1e99999` is always imported as a number.\r\n\r\nFor NaN, `null` also isn't a number, so either way breaks both of these cases, but it at least implies that the data is \"invalid\" while still being readable as JSON, unlike `\"NaN\"` which looks like a valid string. EDIT: Actually, `null` could be collapsed to `0.0` by some importers, so perhaps `\"NaN\"` is better and clearer.\r\n\r\nAnyway, if we want this functionality, it must be opt-in (as already proposed above, so, good). However, this would mean we need to add a parameter to `stringify`, which would change the API, and we'd need to register a compatibility method. This could be done as a separate PR, or if it's really strongly wanted I guess I could put it in this PR. But I'm thinking that this would need a proposal, while this PR by itself is good as-is.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124795644/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3390822986","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108837#issuecomment-3390822986","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108837","id":3390822986,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KG9pK","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-10T15:38:31Z","updated_at":"2025-10-10T15:38:31Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3390822986/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3392674689","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108837#issuecomment-3392674689","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108837","id":3392674689,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KOBuB","user":{"login":"FireCatMagic","id":40964335,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwOTY0MzM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40964335?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FireCatMagic","html_url":"https://github.com/FireCatMagic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FireCatMagic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FireCatMagic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FireCatMagic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FireCatMagic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FireCatMagic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FireCatMagic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FireCatMagic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FireCatMagic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FireCatMagic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-11T00:38:47Z","updated_at":"2025-10-11T00:39:57Z","body":"I'm so confused.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98177\r\nI did this exact implementation last year and everyone told me that it was the wrong way of doing things.\r\nSo then I changed it based on feedback and nobody was happy with that either or the PR in general.\r\n\r\n\r\nDid the consensus change or something?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3392674689/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3392709130","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108837#issuecomment-3392709130","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108837","id":3392709130,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KOKIK","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-11T01:16:09Z","updated_at":"2025-10-11T01:16:09Z","body":"> I'm so confused. #98177 I did this exact implementation last year and everyone told me that it was the wrong way of doing things. So then I changed it based on feedback and nobody was happy with that either or the PR in general.\r\n> \r\n> Did the consensus change or something?\r\n\r\nSorry about this confusion. This was merged in error. We discussed this PR in the core meeting 3 weeks ago and agreed that it should not be merged as-is. Much of the reasoning was based on your comments and the comments of others on your PR. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3392709130/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3392716608","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108837#issuecomment-3392716608","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108837","id":3392716608,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KOL9A","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-11T01:27:13Z","updated_at":"2025-10-11T01:27:13Z","body":"Is this not a breaking change to existing behaviour?\r\n\r\nCurrently, in Godot 4.5, if you run:\r\n```gdscript\r\nprint(JSON.stringify(0))\r\nprint(JSON.stringify(INF))\r\nprint(JSON.stringify(-INF))\r\nprint(JSON.stringify(NAN))\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou get:\r\n```gdscript\r\n0\r\ninf\r\n-inf\r\nnan\r\n```\r\n\r\nRelevant code is in `String::num`: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/16a11ac88b3aedac2825ec570910f34fb40f3f98/core/string/ustring.cpp#L1434","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3392716608/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]